#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/gemm_op/index.rst:54
msgid ""
"Backend dialects extend this signature with their hardware's knobs: "
"``tilelang.cuda.language.gemm`` adds ``mbar`` (Blackwell TCGEN5MMA barrier), "
"``tilelang.rocm.language.gemm`` adds ``k_pack`` (packed MFMA)."
msgstr ""

